    "description": "Learn how to view and manage Deals associated with a Contact.",
    "body": "Linked Deals The Linked Deals tab provides a consolidated view of all sales opportunities associated with a Contact. This enables users to understand the revenue opportunities connected to a specific individual and track the progress of ongoing and historical Deals without leaving the Contact record. Overview A Contact can be associated with multiple Deals throughout the customer lifecycle. The Linked Deals tab serves as a central location for viewing these relationships and monitoring Deal activity. The tab displays all Deals linked to the Contact, regardless of their current status, allowing users to maintain complete visibility into the Contact's sales journey. Deal Relationship Management Every Deal in Sales Astra CRM must be associated with a valid Contact. This relationship ensures that revenue opportunities remain connected to the individuals involved in the buying process. A single Contact can be linked to multiple Deals, including: Active Deals Won Deals Lost Deals Historical Opportunities This allows users to track the complete engagement history of a Contact across multiple sales cycles. Viewing Linked Deals To view linked Deals: 1. Navigate to the Contacts module. 2. Open the required Contact record. 3. Select the Linked Deals tab. The system displays all Deals associated with the Contact. Deal Summary At the top of the page, Sales Astra CRM displays key Deal metrics for the Contact. The summary includes: Total Linked Deals – Total number of Deals associated with the Contact. Open Deals – Number of active Deals currently in progress. Won Deals – Number of successfully closed Deals. Total Deal Value – Combined value of all linked Deals. These metrics provide users with a quick overview of the Contact's overall sales engagement. Viewing Deal Cards Each linked Deal is displayed as an individual Deal card containing: Deal Name Deal Status Deal Value Created Date This allows users to quickly review the Contact's associated opportunities and their current status. Opening a Deal Each Deal card includes a View Deal option. Clicking View Deal opens the corresponding Deal Detail page, where users can: View complete Deal information. Track Deal progress. Review activities. Manage the opportunity throughout its lifecycle. Benefits The Linked Deals tab helps users: View all Deals associated with a Contact. Monitor active and completed opportunities. Understand the Contact's revenue contribution. Access Deal records directly from the Contact profile. Maintain visibility into the Contact's sales history.",
