    "body": "Export Deals The Export Deals feature allows users to download Deal records from the CRM for reporting, analysis, data sharing, auditing, and backup purposes. Users can export all Deals, filtered Deals, or selected Deal records based on their requirements. Accessing Deal Export 1. Navigate to the Deals module. 2. Apply filters or select a Custom View if required. 3. Click Export . 4. Configure export options, if available. 5. Click Export to generate the file. 6. Download the exported file. Export Options Users can export: All Deals Exports all Deal records available in the selected view. Filtered Deals Exports only Deals matching the applied filters. Selected Deals Exports only the Deal records selected using the checkboxes in the Deal list. Common Use Cases Sales Reporting Generate reports for management reviews and performance analysis. Pipeline Analysis Analyze Deal progression, pipeline health, and forecasting data. Data Sharing Share Deal information with internal teams or stakeholders. Data Backup Maintain an offline copy of Deal records for auditing and recovery purposes. Business Intelligence Use exported data in spreadsheets, reporting tools, or analytics platforms. Best Practices Apply filters before exporting to obtain relevant records. Verify selected columns before generating exports. Review exported data for accuracy. Follow organizational data privacy and security guidelines when sharing exported files. Export only the information required for the intended purpose.",
