    "label": "Deals Overview",
    "title": "Deals Overview",
    "to": "/docs/Deals-Module/overview",
    "description": "Learn about the Deals module in Sales Astra CRM.",
    "body": "Deals Overview The Deals module in Sales Astra CRM helps organizations manage sales opportunities from qualification to closure. It provides a centralized workspace where sales teams can track deal progress, manage customer interactions, monitor pipeline stages, and forecast potential revenue. A Deal represents a qualified business opportunity that has the potential to generate revenue. Once a Lead demonstrates buying intent or meets the organization's qualification criteria, it can be converted into a Deal and managed throughout the sales lifecycle until it is successfully closed or marked as lost. The Deals module provides comprehensive tools to organize opportunities, collaborate with team members, automate follow up activities, and gain valuable insights into deal performance. What You Can Do with the Deals Module The Deals module provides a comprehensive set of features to help sales teams efficiently manage opportunities, including: Create and manage Deal records. Track opportunities through customizable sales pipelines. Monitor deal stages and progress. Associate Deals with Contacts and Organizations. Perform Bulk Actions on multiple Deals. Create personalized Custom Views. Search and filter Deal records. Import and Export Deals. Manage Deal activities, including Notes, Tasks, Meetings, and Emails. Create and manage Proposals and Quotes. Monitor Deal Scores and Score Trends. Receive AI powered Smart Nudges for deal recommendations. Deal Management Capabilities The Deals module enables sales teams to manage every stage of the opportunity lifecycle by providing tools for: Capturing opportunity details. Managing pipeline stages. Tracking deal values and expected revenue. Assigning Deal Owners. Scheduling follow up activities. Collaborating with internal teams. Monitoring customer engagement. Tracking proposal and quotation progress. Prioritizing opportunities using AI powered insights. Deal Activities Each Deal maintains a centralized activity timeline, allowing users to manage all customer interactions from a single location. Users can: Create Notes Create Tasks Schedule Meetings Log Meetings Send Emails Track communication history Manage Proposals Manage Quotes This centralized timeline provides complete visibility into customer interactions and supports better collaboration across sales teams. Intelligent Deal Management Sales Astra CRM enhances opportunity management by providing intelligent features that improve sales productivity and decision making. These capabilities include: AI powered Smart Nudges Deal Scoring Deal Score Trends Advanced Search and Filtering Custom Views Bulk Operations Workflow and Sequence Integration These features help sales teams identify high potential opportunities, reduce manual effort, and make informed decisions throughout the sales process. Benefits Using the Deals module enables organizations to: Centralize opportunity management. Improve pipeline visibility. Track sales progress efficiently. Monitor expected revenue. Improve collaboration across sales teams. Increase forecasting accuracy. Prioritize high value opportunities. Improve customer engagement. Increase deal win rates. The Deals module serves as the core of the sales pipeline, enabling organizations to effectively manage every opportunity from qualification through successful closure while maintaining complete visibility into customer interactions, deal progress, and revenue potential.",
