    "body": "Smart Nudges The Smart Nudges panel provides AI powered recommendations that help users take the most effective next actions for a Deal. These recommendations are generated based on available Deal data, activity history, engagement patterns, stage progression, and scoring insights. Purpose of Smart Nudges Smart Nudges help users: Prioritize important actions. Identify Deal risks early. Improve buyer engagement. Maintain sales momentum. Increase conversion rates. Make informed decisions throughout the sales cycle. Nudge Priority Levels Each recommendation is assigned a priority level. Low Medium High Example Smart Nudges Depending on Deal activity and engagement, users may receive recommendations such as: Confirm Client's Decision Making Timeline Encourages users to understand the client's approval process and expected decision timeframe. Address Budget Concerns Proactively Suggests discussing pricing concerns, alternative options, or budget related questions before they become obstacles. Note Smart Nudges are dynamic and may vary based on Deal activity, scoring, and AI analysis. Best Practices for Using Smart Nudges Review recommendations regularly. Prioritize High priority nudges. Act on recommendations promptly. Combine AI recommendations with sales judgment and customer context. Monitor score changes after completing recommended actions.",
