    "to": "/docs/Leads-Module/emails",
    "description": "Sending Emails from Lead Activities The Email feature allows CRM users to compose, send, and track emails directly from the CRM system without switching to external email",
    "body": "Sending Emails from Lead Activities The Email feature allows CRM users to compose, send, and track emails directly from the CRM system without switching to external email applications. All email communication is automatically recorded within the lead activity timeline, helping users maintain complete communication history and improve lead engagement tracking. Accessing the Email Section Steps to Open Email Composer Navigate to the Leads Module. Open the required lead record. Go to the Email tab under Activities. Click Compose Email . This opens the Email Composer window. Email Templates Users can insert pre saved email templates into the email body. Templates help: Save time Maintain communication consistency Improve productivity Insert Options The Email Composer supports insertion of: Email templates CRM documents Meeting links Quotes directly into the email body. Meeting Links Users can insert meeting links from connected calendar providers such as: Google Meet Microsoft Teams Outlook Meet This helps schedule discussions directly through email communication. Send Options The Email module supports multiple sending options. Option Description Send Now Sends email immediately Schedule Send Sends email at selected date and time Save Draft Saves email for later editing Schedule Send Users can schedule emails for future delivery. Scheduled emails appear under Scheduled Activities until they are sent. Save Draft Users can save incomplete emails as drafts and continue editing later. Draft emails display status as Draft . Email Status Tracking The system tracks email statuses such as: Draft Sent Failed This helps users monitor communication activity. Email Activity Logging All sent emails are automatically logged in the Lead Activity Timeline . The logged activity includes: Timestamp Subject Email preview snippet Sender information Associations Email activities are automatically associated with: Lead records Related contacts Related deals This helps maintain centralized communication history.",
