    "body": "Smart Nudges Overview Smart Nudges are AI generated recommendations that help sales teams take the most relevant next action for a Lead. By analyzing Lead information, activity history, communication records, tasks, and engagement patterns, Smart Nudges provide actionable suggestions that help improve follow up effectiveness and increase conversion opportunities. Smart Nudges appear on the right side of the Lead Details page and are updated based on Lead activity and interactions. Benefits of Smart Nudges Smart Nudges help sales teams: Prioritize important follow up activities. Identify the next best action for a Lead. Reduce missed opportunities. Improve engagement with prospects. Maintain consistent follow up processes. Increase productivity and response rates. Viewing Smart Nudges Navigate to the desired Lead record and open the Lead Details page. The Smart Nudges panel displays AI generated recommendations along with supporting information. Each nudge includes: Suggested Action Communication Channel Recommendation Description Priority Level Nudge Components Suggested Action Displays the recommended activity that should be performed. Examples Call Lead to Discuss Options Send Follow Up Email Schedule Site Visit Share Product Brochure Book Product Demo Communication Channel Indicates the preferred communication method for the suggested action. Examples include: Email Call Meeting Recommendation Description Provides additional context explaining why the action is being recommended. Example \"Call the Lead to discuss their apartment preferences and understand their requirements in more detail.\" This helps sales representatives understand the purpose of the recommendation before taking action. Priority Levels Each Smart Nudge includes a priority indicator to help users focus on the most important recommendations.",
