    "label": "Onboarding Overview",
    "title": "Onboarding Overview",
    "to": "/docs/onboarding",
    "description": "Onboarding Overview The onboarding process in Sales Astra CRM includes: 1. User Registration 2. Account Verification 3. Workspace Creation or Selection 4. Team Member Invitation",
    "body": "Onboarding Overview The onboarding process in Sales Astra CRM includes: 1. User Registration 2. Account Verification 3. Workspace Creation or Selection 4. Team Member Invitation 5. Dashboard Access Registration Methods Users can register into Sales Astra CRM using any of the following methods: Email Registration Google Sign In Microsoft Sign In Step 1: Open Sales Astra CRM Launch the Sales Astra CRM application using the provided application URL. Step 2: Click on “Sign Up” Click on the Sign Up option to begin the registration process. Step 3: Choose Registration Method Select one of the available signup methods: Continue with Email Continue with Google Continue with Microsoft Step 4: Enter User Information Provide the required details such as: Full Name Email Address Password Password Requirements Minimum 12 characters At least one lowercase letter At least one uppercase letter At least one number or special symbol After entering the required details, click Create Account . Step 5: Verify Account Users may be required to verify their account through an email verification link or OTP. Step 6: Name Your Workspace Create a unique workspace name for your CRM environment . Why is a Unique Workspace Required in CRM? Ensures secure separation of company data Provides a personalized workspace for each organization Supports role based access and permissions Improves team collaboration and communication Allows custom workflows and dashboards Helps organize leads, tasks, and customer data efficiently Supports scalability as the business grows Enables organization specific reporting and analytics Maintains customer data privacy and security Creates a structured and efficient CRM environment Step 7: Enter Company Details Provide company name and optional company website information. Step 8: Select Company Size Choose the company size from the available options. Step 9: Select Your Role Choose the role that best matches your position within the organization. Step 10: Referral Information Select how you heard about Sales Astra CRM. Step 11: Select Industry Type Choose the industry category that best represents your organization. Step 12: Connect Business Tools Optionally integrate commonly used business tools. Step 13: Invite Team Members Invite teammates to join the workspace. This step is optional. Step 14: Access the Dashboard After completing the onboarding process, users will be redirected to the Sales Astra CRM dashboard. Users can now begin: Managing leads Tracking customer interactions Creating tasks and meetings Collaborating with team members Managing business workflows",
