    "label": "Export Organizations",
    "title": "Export Organizations",
    "to": "/docs/Organizations-Module/export-organizations",
    "description": "Learn how to export Organization records from Sales Astra CRM.",
    "body": "Export Organizations The Export Organizations feature allows users to download Organization data for reporting, analysis, backup, auditing, or external processing. Users can export all Organizations, filtered Organizations, or selected Organization records based on their business requirements. Accessing the Export Feature To export Organization records: 1. Navigate to the Organizations module. 2. Apply any required filters or select specific Organization records. 3. Click Export . 4. The system generates an export file. 5. Download the generated file. Export Options Users can export: All Organizations Exports all Organization records available in the current view. Filtered Organizations Exports only the Organization records matching the currently applied filters or Custom View. Selected Organizations Exports only the Organization records selected using the checkboxes in the Organization list. Exported Information Depending on your organization's configuration, the exported file may include information such as: Organization Name Owner Industry Company Size Revenue Band Website Primary Email Primary Phone Address Information Tags Created Date Last Activity Date Export Benefits The Export Organizations feature helps users: Generate business reports. Perform data analysis. Create offline backups. Share Organization information with authorized stakeholders. Migrate Organization data to external systems. Maintain records for auditing and compliance purposes. Common Use Cases Business Reporting Export Organization data to prepare sales reports, account summaries, and management dashboards. Customer Segmentation Analyze Organizations based on industry, company size, revenue band, or ownership. Data Backup Maintain an offline copy of Organization records for recovery and archival purposes. Data Migration Export Organization records for migration to another CRM or external business application. Best Practices Apply filters before exporting to include only the required Organization records. Verify the exported data before sharing it externally. Ensure compliance with your organization's data security and privacy policies. Store exported files securely to prevent unauthorized access. Export only the information necessary for the intended business purpose.",
