    "label": "Pulse Settings",
    "title": "Pulse Settings",
    "to": "/docs/Pulse-Settings/Overview",
    "description": "Pulse Settings Overview Pulse is the customer engagement and support platform within SalesAstra that enables businesses to interact with website visitors, leads, and customers",
    "body": "Pulse Settings Overview Pulse is the customer engagement and support platform within SalesAstra that enables businesses to interact with website visitors, leads, and customers through chat, automation, AI powered responses, and human support teams. Pulse Settings allow administrators to configure how the chatbot operates, how conversations are routed, who can access the platform, when support is available, and what knowledge sources the AI can use to assist customers. These settings help organizations: Deliver consistent customer support experiences Automate responses to common queries Route conversations to the right agents Manage support team access and permissions Define business availability hours Maintain a centralized knowledge repository Configure chatbot behavior across channels Pulse Settings Modules The Pulse Settings module consists of the following sections: Channels Configure communication channels through which customers can interact with your business, such as: Website chat widgets Messaging platforms Social channels Other supported communication channels Purpose Enable customer communication across multiple channels Centralize conversations within Pulse Improve customer accessibility and engagement Users & Access Manage support agents, administrators, roles, permissions, and access control for the Pulse platform. Capabilities Add and manage support agents Configure user roles Assign permissions Control platform access Manage administrative privileges Purpose Ensure secure platform access Maintain role based permissions Support team management and accountability Assignment Rules Define how incoming conversations are automatically assigned to agents or teams based on predefined conditions and routing logic. Capabilities Automatic conversation routing Team based assignment Rule based distribution Workload balancing Purpose Reduce manual assignment effort Improve response times Ensure conversations reach the appropriate team members Knowledge Base Create and manage articles, FAQs, and information sources that can be used by both AI powered chatbots and support agents. Supported Content Help articles Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs) Troubleshooting guides Product documentation Internal knowledge resources Purpose Improve self service support Provide accurate AI responses Enable faster agent assistance Maintain a centralized information repository Pulse Tags Create and manage reusable labels that agents can apply to Pulse conversations for categorization, filtering, and reporting. Capabilities Create and edit conversation tags Activate or deactivate tags Apply tags to customer conversations Segment conversations for reporting and inbox filtering Purpose Categorize support conversations consistently Improve conversation searchability Support reporting on inquiry types and themes Help agents organize and prioritize chats Support Availability Set business hours, agent availability schedules, holidays, and support operating times to manage customer expectations. Configuration Options Business hours Agent schedules Holiday calendars Availability settings Support operating times Purpose Define support coverage Set customer expectations Manage response availability Support SLA compliance Global Settings Configure organization wide Pulse preferences, chatbot behavior, notification settings, branding, and other default system configurations. Configuration Areas Chatbot behavior Notification preferences Branding settings Default system configurations Organization wide Pulse preferences Purpose Standardize Pulse behavior across the organization Maintain consistent customer experiences Simplify platform administration Benefits of Pulse Settings Properly configuring Pulse Settings helps organizations: Deliver efficient customer support Improve response times Increase customer satisfaction Automate repetitive interactions Maintain consistent support processes Optimize agent productivity Enhance AI powered customer engagement",
